WEBVTT

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.970
"Florence - Early 16th Century"

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:05.290
My lady, I have brought your morning clothes.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:08.040
My lady! How immodest!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.330
I'm at a good part right now.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:50.080
Born into a noble family in Florence,

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:52.520
"I Want to Be an Apprentice"

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.200
I was completely absorbed
in art from a young age.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.410
My father provided me with
an environment to do art,

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.870
but he passed away last month...

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:05.790
Even though we're nobility, we're not
that wealthy, and our current problem...

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.370
...is...

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:12.080
Huh? What? No way!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.750
Mother!

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.870
What are you doing?

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.080
I'm disposing of things we don't need.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.950
Stop that! These are my drawings!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.370
I only allowed you to have
art lessons as a hobby.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:37.620
If you are so absorbed in it,
gentlemen will lose interest in you.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.200
Is it really so important
to be liked by gentlemen?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.080
Yes, it is.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.410
You are almost 15.
You understand, don't you?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.450
With your father gone, we cannot
prepare much of a dowry...

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:56.250
It will be hard to find someone
to take you like that.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.120
If you want to live a decent life in the future,

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.330
your only choice is to be liked
by those gentlemen.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.500
Is the "decent life" you're talking about

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.000
staying at home not being able
to do what I want,

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.250
living each day like a bird in a cage?

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:19.290
You will understand one day how much
I'm thinking of what's good for you.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.580
Father...

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:35.410
Lady Arte, the art teacher has arrived.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.950
Art is not going to do that girl any good.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.750
Come now, don't say that.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:53.160
It's fine for it to be her hobby,
but she's becoming too obsessed.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:56.500
What charm is there in a girl
who is only good at art?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.870
No matter what we had her do,
she looked depressed.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.580
Only when she is drawing do her eyes shine.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:08.250
I love seeing those eyes of hers...

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:13.120
Besides, if she keeps facing forward
and standing with dignity,

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.790
then I won't be the only man
who recognizes her charms.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.000
Father...

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.830
The time is the Renaissance.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:35.870
Inside the city, workshops large
and small line the streets.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:42.250
There, the hands of skilled artisans
give birth to many works of art.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.830
In the workshops, most assistants
are live-in workers.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:52.250
They help with jobs as they study painting
and sculpture under their masters.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.120
Excuse me!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.750
Huh?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.580
Please let me be your apprentice!

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.450
Huh?!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.080
I'll do anything! Please!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.370
What's a noble girl like you saying?!
Go home already!

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.450
Huh?! A female painter?

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.040
Are you making fun of my workshop?!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:22.410
You're getting in the way of work!
Hurry up and go home!

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.200
I failed at 17 in a row...

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.700
There's only one more workshop
in this neighborhood.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.910
There's <i>still</i> one more!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.410
I need to clear my own path myself!

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.790
I told you, it's impossible!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.540
Hurry up and go home!

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.450
What's that? It's noisy...

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.500
At least look at my drawings first--

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.200
I don't have to look at them!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.540
Why not?

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:58.370
Why not? Because you're a girl!

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.910
You want to be an apprentice
even though you're a girl?!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.500
A girl who draws?!

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.080
I won't let a girl cross over my threshold!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.700
H-Hey...

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.250
What do you plan to do with that thing?

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.290
Stop! Don't be hasty!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.790
If everyone's going to keep getting
hung up about me being a girl,

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.250
then I'll give up being a girl!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:44.830
Hm? I see. It's not enough
to cut off my hair, huh?

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:48.870
Then I'll get rid of my breasts, too!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.870
Hey! Stop that!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.250
What are you doing?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.950
Ow...!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.330
Leo?!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.580
Oh, yeah! You don't have
any apprentices, do you?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.790
Why don't <i>you</i> take that girl?

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.580
Huh? What?
What are you talking about?

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:11.330
Jeez... I've been dragged
into something annoying...

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.910
Have such a strange kid foisted on me...

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.000
S-Strange...?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.540
I suppose I did lose my composure a little...

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.910
It was more than just a little.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.080
The whole room is packed with things...

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:34.660
But... each brush and tool
has been carefully looked after.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.250
Amazing!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.910
Well?

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.950
What should I do? This man...

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:48.540
He's somehow scarier than the people
from the other workshops!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.160
Um... Well...

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.160
What?

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.540
Didn't you have business with me?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.000
If not, then get out of here.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.040
I do! I do have business with you!

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.200
I... want to become an artisan.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.700
So... please look at my drawings!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.370
Please!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.450
You're going to look at them?!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.080
What does it look like I'm doing to you?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.120
Thank you very much! I'm so grateful!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.830
No one's even been looking at them,
so I didn't know what I'd do...

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:36.700
Be quiet! If you want me to
look at them, then stop talking.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:39.160
I don't like noise.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.290
Why do you want to be an artist?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.910
Um... I want to be an artist because...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.620
I love drawing...

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.750
I guess that's why...

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.080
When I'm drawing,
it's like I lose track of time,

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:13.750
like I'm so happy that all
I think about is drawing.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.370
Huh? Um...

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.830
Um... Leo...?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.540
I see. Okay.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.790
I'll make you my apprentice.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.000
But under one condition.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.790
That's a lot of wood panels.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.580
Are you going to paint on them?

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:38.200
Yeah. Do you know what "tempera" is?

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:43.080
Oh, yes. It's a paint made by
mixing egg with pigment, right?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.200
Have you ever prepared a panel for painting?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.500
Just once, when my tutor taught me...

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:54.200
You have to clean the surface of the
board thoroughly and sand it carefully.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:59.450
Then, use paste to fill in the knotholes
and paint on layers of undercoat.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:02.120
Then you don't need me to explain it to you.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:08.250
File all of these and paint on the undercoat.
Do it by tomorrow morning.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:13.620
I'll come back tomorrow to check them,
so finish them all by then.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:14.910
Um--

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:19.290
Thank you for giving me a chance!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.040
Well, good luck.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.330
All right, I'll do my best!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:40.040
Oh, if it isn't Leo!

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:44.450
I heard you gave that girl everyone's
talking about an impossible task.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.700
He told her to prepare
20 wood panels in one night.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.330
Even I wouldn't be able to do that.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:52.040
That's seriously playing dirty.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:57.080
Why did you go through all the trouble?
Did that girl do something to you?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.830
Not really...

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:03.290
It's just that a sentimental girl raised
comfortably in a noble's house

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:08.000
is trying to become an artisan
because she "loves drawing"...

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.120
I just don't like it.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.540
Really...?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:17.620
Well, the aloof Leo is on edge today, too, huh?

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:21.790
Please... I beg of you...

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.830
I'll give this to you, so go away!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.870
Thank you very much...

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:37.450
You're a dirty brat!
I don't want another apprentice!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.580
Go somewhere else!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.700
No matter how good your art is,
I don't take beggars!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.540
Not bad...

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.750
Why do you want to join a workshop?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.330
Because...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.830
I don't want to go hungry anymore.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:04.500
I want to live an honest life
through my own power.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.250
I love drawing...

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.290
I guess that's why...

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:19.660
Ouch!

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.450
I wonder, how many have I done?

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.660
One, two, three, four...

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.370
This really is going to be tough.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.200
My hands...

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.330
It's fine! This is nothing.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:43.000
I love art, so I can bear with my
hands hurting and being tired.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.290
♪ I love drawing, I love art ♪

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.580
I can't believe a girl from a noble family
is trying to become an artisan.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.080
I knew it'd be impossible.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.290
It's just as I told you, isn't it?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:08.370
The only way you'll have a decent
life is if you get married.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.080
That's not true!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.000
Definitely...

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.450
I'll definitely...

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.910
...become an artisan!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.080
My head's pounding...

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:40.870
I remembered something I didn't want to
remember, so I ended up drinking too much...

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:46.290
And I didn't feel like going home since
that girl was there... It was terrible.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:52.660
Now... I wonder if she threw in the towel
a long time ago and went home...

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.200
Leo?!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.750
I'm sorry I fell asleep in a place like this!

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.830
No, that's fine, but...

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:15.160
You... You really finished
the task I gave you, huh?

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:23.620
Yes, sir! I worked really, really hard!

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.660
What do you think?

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:32.080
I gave you this condition thinking
you couldn't possibly do it...

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.040
Huh?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:37.500
I had absolutely no intention of making
you my apprentice from the start.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:39.080
That's what I meant.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.080
Oh, really?

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:46.120
Then, I'll have to find a different way
to become an artisan.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.540
Hey, wait.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:52.330
You don't seem upset about this at all.
You're not going to object or anything?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:57.290
Well... I <i>am</i> really shocked, but...

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.700
How do I put it?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:04.330
No one else would even hear me out
just because I'm a girl.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:10.500
But you looked at my drawings,
and even listened to what I had to say.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:15.700
Just that much made me so happy.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.910
Besides, I felt a little guilty, too...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.040
Guilty?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:24.160
Yes. I lied to you earlier.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:28.700
You asked me why I wanted
to become an artisan, right?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:29.620
Yeah.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:37.000
I said it was because I love drawing,
but I was trying to act a little too cool.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:43.540
For me, becoming an artisan isn't
a goal--it's a means to an end.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.790
In reality, I did understand...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.410
"I love drawing."

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:51.120
I didn't get this far on just that
one neat and tidy emotion.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.450
I was frustrated... Even angry...

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.580
That's what drove me to act.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.870
I know just how hard it is for a woman
to make a living by herself.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:08.040
That's why... because all I have is art...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.410
Rather than living in a birdcage,

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.790
even if it means I'll die by the
side of the road somewhere...

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.450
I want to learn at a workshop

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:19.620
and find a path that lets me live
through my own power.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.830
I don't want to go hungry anymore.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:26.950
I want to live an honest life
through my own power.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:31.910
Um, Leo?

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.750
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.700
Why is it that even though our births
and circumstances are different,

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.790
I see the past me when I look at her?

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.500
Well... I guess I should
keep my promise, after all.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:53.040
Okay. As promised, I'll make you my apprentice.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.000
This time I mean it.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:02.370
R-Really?! You'll really let me
join your workshop?

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.660
You can't take it back later, you know.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:07.410
Because you promised!
You can't break your promise!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:10.870
Quiet down. If you don't be quiet,
then I'll call it off.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:14.290
Then... I'm really...

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.000
I am <i>not</i> going to cry!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:26.200
I mean, a boy wouldn't cry
at a time like this, right?

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.950
What's the matter, Leo?

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:36.080
Oh, it's nothing.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.870
I took in a weird one, huh?

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:44.330
Then, I look forward to working with you, Leo--

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:48.000
I mean, Master... right?

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.330
Master!

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.330
I told you, quiet down!

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:54.750
Wait a minute, Arte!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:56.790
I will not allow it!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:59.370
I don't care if you'll allow it or not.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.330
I'm going no matter what you say, Mother.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.370
What kind of foolish thing are you saying?

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:09.120
For a woman to say she wants to be an artist--
You will definitely regret this!

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:14.910
But, Mother, if I get married like this,
I will also definitely regret it!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:23.200
If I'm going to regret it either way,

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.330
then I want to have regrets
doing what I want to do.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.700
Oh, it's you...

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.250
You really came.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:43.620
U-Um, I look forward to working
with you starting today!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.330
You don't need to stand on ceremony.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.200
I'll show you where you'll sleep.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.410
Yes, sir!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:58.540
Starting today, I'm an apprentice artisan
working at this workshop.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:02.120
There's a shed built into the roof...

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:04.580
But it's dilapidated since it
hasn't been used for a while.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.540
Well, as the saying goes,
there's no place like home, or something.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.040
Starting today, this is your castle.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.160
Once you fix it up, it should be pretty livable.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.080
Do your best.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:23.330
Huh?! <i>I'm</i> fixing this place up?! By myself?!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.620
Anyway, will it really become livable?!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.200
Huh? Do you want to live in it like this?

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.250
I don't care either way.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.700
Later.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.120
Huh?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.290
I'm sleeping here today?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.950
Where else would you sleep?

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.290
Unless you're saying you want to sleep with me?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.330
No, thank you. I'll sleep here.

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.290
If I'm going to regret it either way,

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:55.000
then I want to have regrets doing
what I want to do, right?

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.910
Yay! This is just what I wanted!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:03.790
This is no good. It's so cold,
I can't fall asleep.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.250
I'll draw to distract myself!

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:30.200
When I look at it in the light,
it's actually a pretty nice room.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:33.410
This desk is broken, but cute.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.450
I'll fix these shelves and
put my art supplies on them.

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.200
Starting today...

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.200
Starting today, this is your castle.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:11.410
All right, I'll do my best!

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:59.410
"Preview"

00:23:56.370 --> 00:24:01.160
Somehow, I got made an apprentice,
but will I be able to get along with Leo?

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:05.200
Hey, what are you dawdling for?
Hurry up and clean the workroom!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:11.010
"A New Life"

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:07.540
Even if he's strict, I'll do my best!

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.160
Next time, "A New Life."

00:24:09.160 --> 00:24:10.950
It's starting!
